[h1]February 28 - Update (v0.12.4)[/h1]

Hey everyone, we have some updates to share with you all.

[h2]Changes[/h2]
[list]
[*] Connected loading screens to biomes of the run started or ended;
[*] Now Elites and Bosses produce higher value souls, that grants respectively 3 and 5 SP;
[*] Added Elder Tree node to the legend in map;
[*] Battle dashboard now displays also max health;
[*] Removed selection during enemy turns;
[*] Minor graphic changes;
[/list]

[h2]BugFix[/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed bug that enabled selector at the start of a battle;
[*] Fixed bug that show dashboard of a Soulkin hovered at the end of the previous battle;
[*] Fixed bug that didn't show correctly tooltip of enemy skills;
[*] Fixed bug that gave multiple times the same blessings during a run;
[*] Fixed bug that sometimes didn't let you collect soul;
[*] Fixed bug that didn't let some skills work on Nadia or Bosses;
[*] Fixed bug that didn't let enemy end their turn if one of their Soulkin is defeated in that turn;
[*] Fixed bug that didn't correctly heal Soulkin between acts;
[*] Fixed bug that sometimes didn't correctly save Soulkin upgrades;
[/list]

[h2]Known Bugs[/h2]
[list]
[*] Sometimes after leaving a shop in which the player purchase an item/service it's impossible to select the next node in map.
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44894006/099ba0c223017c9cefc5ac8d18533357b037fbc2.jpg[/img]
[h1]November 20 - Update (v0.10.1)[/h1]

Hey everyone, we have some updates to share with you all.

[h2]New features[/h2]
[list]
[*] Added an onboarding flow for the first battle of a new save;
[*] Added status tooltip: now when seeing a skill, status are highlighted and going hover on them a small tooltip appear explaining what that status does;
[*] Added new summoning animation;
[*] Now new run will start directly from a battle, instead from the map;
[/list]


[h2]Changes[/h2]
[list]
[*] General minor graphic changes;
[*] Added and fixed some sound effects;
[/list]

[h2]Bug[/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed bug that didn't incorrectly update affinity between runs;
[*] Fixed bug that sometimes shows Dodge effect when selecting a Soulkin for an attack even if it didn't have Dodge;
[*] Fixed bug that sometimes broke Soulkin animations when visting the Squad;
[*] Fixed bug that sometimes didn't show the correct Soulkin during trimming ooperation;
[/list]

[h2]Working on[/h2]
[list]
[*] Adding Gamepad support;
[*] Localizing the game in additional languages;
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44894006/26e9e68b90baca3ebb93cfb7f600a057724a7c36.png[/img]

[h1]Hotfix v. 0.10.0.1[/h1]
[list]
[*] Fixed bug that didn't correctly show some Elite Soulkin Icons;
[*] Fixed bug that sometimes didn't process save data of  previous updates;
[*] Fixed bug that didn't let new players make a save after a run;
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44894006/26e9e68b90baca3ebb93cfb7f600a057724a7c36.png[/img]

[h1]October 14 - Update (v0.9.9)[/h1]

Hey everyone, we have some updates to share with you all.

[h2]New features[/h2]
[list]
[*] Added german localization;
[/list]

[h2]Balancing[/h2]
[list]
[*] Update Collection rewards and steps to achieve that reward;
[*] Reduced number of Event and Bonus nodes that can appear in a run;
[*] Increased number of normal battle nodes that can appear in a run;
[*] Energy rewarded at the end of a normal battle: 0 -> 2;
[*] "Bubble" skill: -> An Ally within range 2 gains a shield, lasting until your next turn, that negates the first damage taken, then it expires;
[*] Catemori Atk: 3 -> 2;
[*] Kintsu skill: Blaze -> Fiery;
[*] Elite Akakuma skill: Counter -> Retaliate;
[*] Changed starting artifact list;
[/list]

[h2]Changes[/h2]
[h3]Options[/h3]
[list]
[*] Minor graphic changes;
[/list]
[h3]Map[/h3]
[list]
[*] Minor graphic changes;
[*] Updated map generation algorithm;
[/list]
[h3]Battle[/h3]
[list]
[*] Minor graphic changes;
[*] Skill buttons now are fully clickable;
[*] Changed Armor vfx;
[/list]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed bug that didn't let ai end the turn;
[*] Fixed bug that didn't update missing hearts;
[*] Fixed bug that brought the rewards from previous run on to the next one.

[/list]

[h1]Known Bugs and WIP[/h1]

[h2]Working on[/h2]
[list]
[*] Adding Gamepad support;
[*] Localizing the game in additional languages;
[*] Update Tutorial;
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44894006/26e9e68b90baca3ebb93cfb7f600a057724a7c36.png[/img]

[h1]September 18 - Update (v0.9.8)[/h1]

Hey everyone, we have some updates to share with you all.

[h2]New features[/h2]
[list]
[*] Introduced the ability to save during a run. It is automatically done after completing a node or pressing "SaveAndQuit" button in Options: It is possible to continue the run pressing play and clicking on "Continue" button that appear on Region Selection screen;
[*] Added a new Loading screen when moving from Home to Map and vice versa;
[*] Added transition effect when starting a battle;
[/list]

[h2]Changes[/h2]
[h3]Region selection[/h3]
[list]
[*] Minor graphic changes; 
[/list]
[h3]Options[/h3]
[list]
[*] Minor graphic changes;
[*] Added "SaveAndQuit" button;
[/list]
[h3]Map[/h3]
[list]
[*] Minor graphic changes;
[*] Reduced time from when pressing the Surrender button in map to the actual end run screen;
[/list]
[h3]Battle[/h3]
[list]
[*] Minor graphic changes
[/list]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed bug that didn't correctly show chest sprites in battle;
[*] Fixed bug that show action points of the last clicked soulkin when showing information about a soulkin not in battlefield;
[*] Fixed bug that show a wrong tooltip on crystals that appear in artifact selection after a battle;
[*] Fixed bug that showed "Saved" on a Soul if the creature died after attacking an enemy creature due to an enemy effect;
[*] Fixed bug that didn't correctly mark the checkbox on a regional objective;
[*] Fixed bug that didn't show Elite Sandagha and Elite Akakuma in Collection;

[/list]

[h1]Known Bugs and WIP[/h1]

[h2]Known Bugs[/h2]
[list]
[*] Some texts are out of bounds of their containing box;
[*] Sometimes enemy doesn't end turn;
[/list]
[h2]Working on[/h2]
[list]
[*] Adding Gamepad support;
[*] Localizing the game in additional languages;
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44894006/26e9e68b90baca3ebb93cfb7f600a057724a7c36.png[/img]

[h1]September 2 - Update (v0.9.7)[/h1]

Hey everyone, we have some updates to share with you all.

[h2]New features[/h2]
[list]
[*] Added Italian localization;
[*] Introduced the ability to remove Soulkin from the squad. On the map during squad preview, there is now a button for each Soulkin that allows you to remove it from the squad for that run, by paying a certain amount of crystals. In exchange, the energy used to catch that Soulkin is returned. The crystal cost increases each time this action is performed;
[/list]
[h2]Changes[/h2]
[h3]Home[/h3]
[list]
[*] Minor graphic changes;
[*] Added some new SFXs; 
[/list]
[h3]ChooseRegion[/h3]
[list]
[*] Minor graphic changes; 
[/list]
[h3]Options[/h3]
[list]
[*] Minor graphic changes;
[*] Added some new SFXs;
[/list]
[h3]Localization[/h3]
[list]
[*] Revised some texts;
[/list]
[h3]Map[/h3]
[list]
[*] Revised Map generation algorithm;
[/list]
[h3]Battle[/h3]
[list]
[*] Removed hover functionality for tokens (Soulkin, Chest, Obstacles, Soul, etc.) on the battlefield. Now, to check information on the dashboard, you must click on the specific token;
[/list]

[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed bug that showed affinity popup in battles after defeating an elite soulkin; 
[*] Fixed bug that didn't show checkmark upon regional objective completion;
[*] Fixed bug that sometimes increased at each battle the max number of summonable soulkin;
[/list]

[h1]Known Bugs and WIP[/h1]

[h2]Known Bugs[/h2]
[list]
[*] Some texts are out of bounds of their containing box;
[/list]
[h2]Working on[/h2]
[list]
[*] Adding the ability to save during a run and resume in another game session;
[*] Adding Gamepad support;
[*] Localizing the game in additional languages;
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44894006/26e9e68b90baca3ebb93cfb7f600a057724a7c36.png[/img]

[h1]August 14 - Update (v0.9.6)[/h1]

Hey everyone, we have some updates to share with you all.

[h2]Battle[/h2]
[list]
[*] Added effect that let you know where a Soulkin or obstacle after you attack with a Soulkin with "Push" skill;
[*] Updated Soul tooltip text, to inform that a Nadia AP will be consumed to catch the soul;
[*] Changed text when getting a Soul of an already owned Soulkin from "Recovered" to "Saved";
[*] Updated popup when getting an Artifact from a chest;
[/list]
[h2]Run[/h2]
[list]
[*] When you end a run, on each reward screen there will be images connected to the obtained reward;
[/list]
[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed bug that didn't update prices of artifacts when getting Discount Artifact from Octo;
[*] Fixed typo on Tutorial;
[*] Fixed bug that didn't show the correct sprite in battlefield of Elite Aknat;
[*] Fixed bug that didn't let you select an hexagon or a token when there was "Collected" text, after a soul is captured;
[*] Fixed bug that let the "Collected" text reappear after clicking on the hexagon under it;
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44894006/26e9e68b90baca3ebb93cfb7f600a057724a7c36.png[/img]

[h1]August 9 - Update (v0.9.5)[/h1]

Hey everyone, we have some updates to share with you all.

[h2]Battle[/h2]
[list]
[*] Update vfx "Splash" skill;
[*] Update vfx "Tsunami" skill; 
[*] Improved shrink animation of Souls;
[/list]
[h2]Credits[/h2]
[list]
[*] Added Blur effect on background; 
[/list]
[h2]Options[/h2]
[list]
[*] Added Blur effect on background; 
[*] Added Language option (at the moment the only available language is English);
[/list]
[h2]Tutorial[/h2]
[list]
[*] Added Blur effect on background; 
[/list]
[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed bug that did a little flash when pressing Play button in Home; 
[*] Fixed bug that didn't show the correct number of medals slot in the collection based on the number of unlockable reward;
[*] Fixed bug that didn't summon Muthonk on its boss battle;
[*] Fixed bug that let Octo sell artifacts already obtained;
[*] Fixed bug that sometimes let "Gelid" skill activate when attacking obstacles;
[*] Fixed bug that didn't update the number of controlled Soulkin when some switch side after Kurgalan "Mind Control" skill;
[/list]
[h2]Known Bugs[/h2]
[list]
[*] Nadia Hearts disappear instead of switching off;
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44894006/56ac16723795980293388c81d62c53236fce8b7c.png[/img]

[h1]August 2 - Update (v0.9.4)[/h1]

Hey everyone, we have some updates to share with you all.

Starting from this version the information about the number of runs done will be saved, and it will not count games played on previous versions
[h2]Balancing[/h2]
[list]
[*] During Boss fights Elite enemies are substituted by normal enemies;
[*] Chance to battle against Soulkin of SV 4 or 5 on the first encounters;
[*] Artifact Overcharged Fang: Energy given 2 -> 3;
[*] Artifact Creativity Bracelet: Energy given 1 -> 2;
[*] Artifact Vial of Evanescence: Soulkin can ignore Souls too;
[*] Artifact Superdense Cube: Damage 1 -> 2;
[*] Artifact Quickstart Wheel: "At the start of turn, a random ally Soulkin adjacent to Nadia gains 1 AP and can perform an additional movement this turn";
[*] Catemori first Collection reward requirement: 5 -> 1;
[*] Umimi first Collection reward requirement: 5 -> 1;
[*] Gauridion first Collection reward requirement: 5 -> 2;
[*] Peavolus first Collection reward requirement: 5 -> 2;
[*] Wingalea inverted Collection rewards
[*] Elite Units Defeat Energy reward: 5 -> 10;
[*] Boss defeat Crystal Reward: 25 -> 20;
[*] Normal Soulkin defeat Crystal Reward: Soul Value -> Soul Value - 1;
[*] Status "Scared": "This Soulkin uses 2 AP to attack, instead of 1.";
[*] Status "Restrained": "This Soulkin uses 2 AP to move, instead of 1";
[*] Skill "Inspiration": “An allied Soulkin gains 1 AP and can perform an additional movement this turn.”;
[/list]
[h2]Map[/h2]
[list]
[*] Shown node difficulty level on Battle Node Preview;
[*] Update aesthetics of Battle Node Previews;
[/list]
[h2]Run[/h2]
[list]
[*] Added animation when obtaining an Artifact during the run;
[*] Added animation on the screen at the end of the battle;
[*] Added animation on selection artifact screen at the end of an Elite or Boss battle;
[/list]
[h2]Battle[/h2]
[list]
[*] Status information can be seen from Soulkin in battle;
[*] Status information are more easily to be seen in the bottom left screen; 
[/list]
[h2]Credits[/h2]
[list]
[*] Added Credits screen visible from Options
[/list]
[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed bug that didn't show correct artifact names in Octo Screen; 
[*] Fixed bug that didn't show the correct Life Reward;
[*] Fixed bug that didn't show Impadon first Collection reward text;
[*] Maybe fixed bug that didn't let AI end its turn;
[/list]
[h2]Known Bugs[/h2]
[list]
[*] Sometimes Octo can sell artifacts already obtained;
[*] Nadia Hearts disappear instead of switching off;
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44894006/56ac16723795980293388c81d62c53236fce8b7c.png[/img]

[h1]July 27 - Update (v0.9.2)[/h1]

Hey everyone, we have some updates to share with you all.

If following the reward changing, you obtained a reward from the ones changed and the game do not recognise this, try to start and finish a run, reach the Home and after that restart the game. 
[h2]Balancing[/h2]
[list]
[*] Kurgalan Atk: 3 -> 2;
[*] Kabutoroi Hp: 6 -> 5;
[*] Umimi Atk: 1 -> 2, Hp: 6 -> 4;
[*] Biriwack Hp: 7 -> 6;
[*] Whixy first Collection reward requirement: 5 -> 1;
[*] Maytis first Collection reward requirement: 5 -> 3;
[*] Spitfin first Collection reward requirement: 5 -> 3;
[*] Biriwack first Collection reward requirement: 5 -> 1;
[*] Nealid first Collection reward requirement: 5 -> 3;
[*] Starting Nadia soul points: 10 -> 8;
[*] Elite Units Defeat Crystal reward: 10 -> 5;
[*] Boss defeat Crystal Reward: 50 -> 25;
[*] Boss defeat Energy Reward: 10 -> 15;
[/list]
[h2]Map[/h2]
[list]
[*] Shown Collection Progress of each discovered Soulkin on Battle Node Preview;
[*] Shown Soulkin not yet encountered with a "?" on Battle Node Preview;
[/list]
[h2]Run[/h2]
[list]
[*] When you end a run, there is a new popup showing the affinity progress reached during the run;
[*] When you end a run, you can choose to go to Collection or simply return to Home;
[*] Improved end run recap flow;
[/list]
[h2]Collection[/h2]
[list]
[*] Clicking on a Soulkin let you see the Soulkin information, without the need of hovering on it;
[*] Revised and updated reward texts;
[*] Added Zapien second Collection reward;
[*] Added Luona second Collection reward;
[*] Added Kintsu second Collection reward;
[*] Added Aknat second Collection reward;
[/list]
[h2]Home[/h2]
[list]
[*] Revised after "Play" button popup to better convey the objective of the game;
[/list]
[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed bug that didn't let players use Nadia unlocked upgraded skill , after launching the game;
[*] Fixed bug that didn't show the change of owner of a Soulkin after Kurgalan used "Mind Control" skill;
[*] Fixed text during Region Selection that overlapped name of the Boss with its checkbox;
[*] Fixed bug that didn't show Carawurm second Collection reward text;
[/list]
[h2]Known Bugs[/h2]
[list]
[*] "Null" skill doesn't remove "Armored";
[*] "Cleanse" and "Revitalize" skills don't remove "Restrained" status;
[*] "Aggressive" use one action movement;
[*] Affinity increase notification remains on battle after an Elite or Boss Battle;
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44894006/56ac16723795980293388c81d62c53236fce8b7c.png[/img]

[h1]July 1- Demo Update (v0.7.7)[/h1]

Hey everyone, we have some sweet updates on the demo to share with you all.

[h2]Platform[/h2]
[list]
[*] Release demo for MacOs;
[/list]
[h2]UI[/h2]
[h3]Options[/h3]
[list]
[*] Updated UI Options;
[*] Options (including Tutorial) are now accessible from Home, too;
[*] Added controls to modify Music and Sound effects volume;
[*] Added controls to change language for future release;
[/list]
[h2]Bug Fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed bug that blocked player from clicking new nodes in Map after selecting a clouded Node;
[*] Fixed bug that generated multiple battle instances at the same time, if the player quitted a previous battle;
[/list]
